WEBVTT

00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:04.300
Everyone, thank you!

00:00:16.980 --> 00:00:19.730
Konno, it was a huge success!

00:00:19.730 --> 00:00:22.110
It was all because of you. Thank you!

00:00:22.110 --> 00:00:24.710
That's not true.
I just worked behind the scenes...

00:00:24.710 --> 00:00:27.780
Well, what did you think?
How were we today?

00:00:27.780 --> 00:00:30.160
Of course, you were great!

00:00:34.150 --> 00:00:37.170
You're squeezing too tight...

00:00:38.230 --> 00:00:42.010
Oh, I fell asleep standing up again.

00:00:44.570 --> 00:00:48.140
This is the story of the new manager, Konno Aoi,

00:00:48.140 --> 00:00:51.100
diligently working hard with furious force
together with her friends,

00:00:51.100 --> 00:00:53.980
sometimes writhing in pain
and having a hard time,

00:00:53.980 --> 00:00:57.190
but never giving up on her dream
of becoming a top manager!

00:02:31.850 --> 00:02:33.580
My name is Konno Aoi.

00:02:33.580 --> 00:02:35.710
Nice to meet you.

00:02:36.380 --> 00:02:38.530
Now, allow me to begin.

00:02:38.530 --> 00:02:40.630
Y-Yes, please.

00:02:41.100 --> 00:02:46.170
The sound production company that I work with

00:02:46.170 --> 00:02:49.980
will be holding auditions
for the anime version of this manga.

00:02:50.600 --> 00:02:52.510
Please take a look at the materials.

00:02:52.510 --> 00:02:53.480
Th-Thank you.

00:02:54.060 --> 00:02:55.900
Ichinose Futaba-san...

00:02:55.900 --> 00:03:01.060
She's still a junior seiyuu, and I've heard
she works hard and is really motivated...

00:03:02.630 --> 00:03:04.360
Huh? Is she glaring at me?

00:03:04.360 --> 00:03:08.160
She's a new manager,
and I think she's around my age, but...

00:03:08.160 --> 00:03:10.700
She makes me nervous...

00:03:10.700 --> 00:03:15.860
With regard to this, I would definitely
like you to audition for a role, Ichinose-san.

00:03:15.860 --> 00:03:16.880
What?!

00:03:18.110 --> 00:03:23.590
First, new managers must learn
the names and voices of the actors-koro.

00:03:24.780 --> 00:03:29.320
The job of a manager is to connect seiyuu to jobs.
In other words, they're intermediaries.

00:03:29.320 --> 00:03:32.400
In order to allow the seiyuu
to do their all in the studio,

00:03:32.400 --> 00:03:37.520
managers must coordinate schedules,
gather materials, and check different things

00:03:37.520 --> 00:03:39.840
to make sure they are completely prepared-koro.

00:03:39.840 --> 00:03:40.820
Koro!

00:03:41.550 --> 00:03:44.820
Ichinose Futaba's schedule book
is completely blank.

00:03:44.820 --> 00:03:49.110
Speaking of which, we should receive the results
from the audition the other day soon.

00:03:49.110 --> 00:03:50.030
Konno!

00:03:50.030 --> 00:03:51.410
Y-Yes?

00:03:51.410 --> 00:03:54.480
We got the results of
Ichinose Futaba's audition.

00:03:54.480 --> 00:03:55.420
She didn't get it.

00:03:56.540 --> 00:03:58.020
I see...

00:03:58.190 --> 00:03:59.910
Ichinose Futaba

00:04:01.230 --> 00:04:04.540
The results won't change
even if you fret over them.

00:04:04.540 --> 00:04:05.550
Atsumari-san...

00:04:05.550 --> 00:04:08.840
Don't think about it so much.
Just tell her quickly.

00:04:08.840 --> 00:04:11.060
That'll make it easier for her, too.

00:04:11.890 --> 00:04:13.530
Quickly...

00:04:16.310 --> 00:04:17.270
A call!

00:04:17.270 --> 00:04:19.780
Th-This is Ichinose Futaba.

00:04:19.780 --> 00:04:21.480
Oh, this is Konno.

00:04:21.480 --> 00:04:22.580
I am calling about work.

00:04:23.840 --> 00:04:25.730
Do it quickly and casually.

00:04:26.630 --> 00:04:29.240
About the audition the other day,
you didn't get the part.

00:04:30.760 --> 00:04:33.520
U-Um, good-bye then.

00:04:37.350 --> 00:04:39.830
Did it come as that much of a shock to her?

00:04:39.830 --> 00:04:44.300
Of course it did. Because each audition
is an important chance for her.

00:04:44.300 --> 00:04:47.090
Konno, you have something
at 7 p.m., don't you?

00:04:48.130 --> 00:04:49.350
Oh, yes!

00:04:49.350 --> 00:04:50.920
I'll be back!

00:04:51.570 --> 00:04:56.800
Managers at seiyuu agencies
aren't in charge of individual seiyuu;

00:04:56.800 --> 00:05:01.600
rather, they work with specific sound
production agencies and broadcasters-koro.

00:05:01.600 --> 00:05:05.060
It's normal to be working on
a lot of different things at once-koro.

00:05:06.050 --> 00:05:09.190
The next day

00:05:11.540 --> 00:05:14.040
"I'll have the curry. Normally..."

00:05:14.040 --> 00:05:17.160
Good morning, I'm from Aozora Production.

00:05:18.810 --> 00:05:19.480
"I'll have the-"

00:05:19.480 --> 00:05:22.250
Oh, Konno-san, thanks for your hard work!

00:05:23.540 --> 00:05:26.760
The job before this ended early,
so I came to get scripts...

00:05:26.760 --> 00:05:28.460
How's it going?

00:05:28.460 --> 00:05:33.270
Well... Even when I only have one line,
there's a lot to improve on...

00:05:34.270 --> 00:05:36.790
But I'll do my best in the second half!

00:05:36.790 --> 00:05:38.520
I don't have any more lines, though...

00:05:39.870 --> 00:05:42.960
I see. I hope you get to do some walla.

00:05:44.070 --> 00:05:45.190
Yes!

00:05:45.190 --> 00:05:48.650
Thanks for waiting! We'll start part B now!

00:05:48.650 --> 00:05:50.690
Okay!

00:05:50.690 --> 00:05:53.200
Oh, do you still have enough to drink?

00:05:53.200 --> 00:05:55.740
Are you cold inside?

00:05:55.740 --> 00:05:58.210
I'm fine. Thank you!

00:05:59.770 --> 00:06:01.420
Aozora Pro?

00:06:02.400 --> 00:06:03.960
Thanks for your hard work.

00:06:03.960 --> 00:06:07.080
We just got some additional scripts.

00:06:07.080 --> 00:06:08.800
Yes, I'll take those back with me.

00:06:08.800 --> 00:06:12.350
But they're heavy. Can you carry them all?

00:06:13.780 --> 00:06:16.850
No problem. Thank you very much.

00:06:23.080 --> 00:06:24.860
Oh, welcome!

00:06:33.740 --> 00:06:35.800
I'm back...

00:06:41.720 --> 00:06:43.730
Konno, do you have a minute?

00:06:43.730 --> 00:06:44.500
Yes.

00:06:45.610 --> 00:06:48.540
Debuting as a unit... correct?

00:06:48.540 --> 00:06:52.670
Their radio show is pretty well received,
too, so they thought it might work.

00:06:52.670 --> 00:06:57.220
It'd be with Moesaki-san and Kohana-san, too,
and it's a great chance for lchinose, right?

00:06:57.220 --> 00:07:00.370
Yes, I think it is a good idea.

00:07:00.370 --> 00:07:03.930
I'm counting on you to be
the manager for the unit,

00:07:03.930 --> 00:07:07.520
so you'll have to cooperate
with Kaibara-san like in a three-legged race...

00:07:07.520 --> 00:07:08.860
But, well, good luck.

00:07:08.860 --> 00:07:10.670
Kaibara-san...

00:07:13.530 --> 00:07:16.440
It'll be hard to work with him, you know...

00:07:16.440 --> 00:07:17.700
Will you be all right by yourself?

00:07:26.400 --> 00:07:28.170
Yes! I'll do my best!

00:07:50.040 --> 00:07:51.610
Yes, this is Konno!

00:08:01.850 --> 00:08:03.670
Five, six, seven, eight...

00:08:04.220 --> 00:08:05.830
Good work, everyone.

00:08:05.830 --> 00:08:07.040
Konno-san!

00:08:07.040 --> 00:08:09.210
Yay, break time, break time!

00:08:09.210 --> 00:08:10.060
Hey!

00:08:10.060 --> 00:08:10.920
Yay!

00:08:10.920 --> 00:08:11.840
Huh?

00:08:15.320 --> 00:08:17.970
Jeez, are these refreshments for us?

00:08:18.440 --> 00:08:19.970
Is it not enough?

00:08:19.970 --> 00:08:22.460
Huh? No, um...

00:08:22.460 --> 00:08:24.680
You don't think large orders
of beef bowl are enough?

00:08:24.680 --> 00:08:27.000
What are we, hungry active boys?

00:08:27.000 --> 00:08:30.900
If possible, it'd be nice
to have something more girly...

00:08:30.900 --> 00:08:33.110
I see, more girly...

00:08:33.110 --> 00:08:34.520
She's taking notes?!

00:08:34.520 --> 00:08:35.780
She's oblivious!

00:08:35.780 --> 00:08:38.700
But I'm glad for this!

00:08:38.700 --> 00:08:43.660
Konno-san, I can't finish this in one sitting,
so if there are leftovers, can I take them home?

00:08:43.660 --> 00:08:45.670
Yes, of course.

00:08:45.670 --> 00:08:47.510
Let's eat!

00:08:47.510 --> 00:08:50.340
I don't get to eat this often,
so I'm happy, too!

00:08:52.630 --> 00:08:54.340
Oh, yum!

00:08:55.780 --> 00:08:58.710
Well, it's not like I won't eat it...

00:08:58.710 --> 00:09:00.350
Just this once, okay?

00:09:00.350 --> 00:09:03.310
lchigo-san, do you want red pickled ginger?

00:09:03.310 --> 00:09:06.080
Of course! Give me some shichimi, too.

00:09:06.080 --> 00:09:08.390
Okay, one order of shichimi coming up!

00:09:08.390 --> 00:09:09.310
One order?

00:09:11.020 --> 00:09:12.540
Let's eat!

00:09:28.310 --> 00:09:31.790
I believe <i>Mochi-Kuma</i>
and <i>Victorian</i> are airing tonight.

00:09:31.790 --> 00:09:34.290
Are our actors appearing...?

00:09:39.560 --> 00:09:44.760
Um, this is just for me, Kohana Rin...

00:09:44.760 --> 00:09:48.380
The manga currently being serialized in Weekly Shonen Zunder,

00:09:48.380 --> 00:09:52.400
<i>SPIRAL CAFÉ,</i> will have an anime starting January.

00:09:52.400 --> 00:09:55.570
I will be playing the role of Uma.

00:10:03.510 --> 00:10:06.830
Um, I received a call about a job-

00:10:06.830 --> 00:10:09.030
Yes, congratulations.

00:10:09.030 --> 00:10:11.160
Will you talk to the
receptionist about the details?

00:10:11.160 --> 00:10:12.210
Yes!

00:10:12.210 --> 00:10:15.870
Oh, the cast list was sent over.
And here's the proposal.

00:10:15.870 --> 00:10:17.220
Please look over them.

00:10:17.220 --> 00:10:19.420
Okay, thank you!

00:10:19.420 --> 00:10:23.680
I love the manga this is based on!
I never thought I'd be chosen for it...

00:10:35.360 --> 00:10:37.140
Good morning!

00:10:38.630 --> 00:10:42.120
Shiodome-san! Um, how's lchinose-san?

00:10:43.180 --> 00:10:46.990
She won't survive in this business
if this keeps her down.

00:10:46.990 --> 00:10:49.120
The rest is up to her.

00:10:49.660 --> 00:10:50.540
But...

00:10:51.310 --> 00:10:54.450
Believe in the actor and wait quietly.

00:10:54.450 --> 00:10:57.710
That's what a manager's
supposed to do, right, Kon-Kon?

00:10:58.900 --> 00:11:00.800
I'm going to get my script!

00:11:02.700 --> 00:11:04.720
"Kon-Kon"?

00:11:07.720 --> 00:11:09.680
Earphones
<b>PV Filming</b>

00:11:10.970 --> 00:11:14.360
I'm sure she's still being
affected by her feelings.

00:11:15.920 --> 00:11:18.360
And she was filming in that state...?

00:11:20.610 --> 00:11:21.700
...masu ne
...to visit

00:11:21.700 --> 00:11:27.080
L to R hitorijime waratta kimi wa suki dakara
Keeping L and R for ourselves because we love it when you smile

00:11:27.080 --> 00:11:30.910
hora ne Earphones wa sou yume no iriguchi
Look, Earphones are the way to your dreams

00:11:32.500 --> 00:11:32.830
ne?
See?

00:11:35.290 --> 00:11:35.630
kya
Oh!

00:11:38.050 --> 00:11:38.300
chuu
Kiss!

00:11:42.840 --> 00:11:47.010
Okay, we'll use that! Man, that was really good!

00:11:47.010 --> 00:11:48.550
Oh, thank you so much!

00:11:48.550 --> 00:11:50.480
Thank you very much!

00:11:54.480 --> 00:11:59.720
Um, about Ichinose Futaba-
I gave you her voice demo the other day...

00:11:59.720 --> 00:12:01.140
Oh yeah, I listened to it.

00:12:01.140 --> 00:12:02.430
Thank you very much.

00:12:02.430 --> 00:12:06.160
She's gotten popular on the radio, and recently,
she's also started working in a unit...

00:12:06.160 --> 00:12:09.240
Really? Well, if something comes up.

00:12:09.800 --> 00:12:11.430
I look forward to hearing from you!

00:12:21.170 --> 00:12:23.610
All right! l've got the
dance and the Iyrics down!

00:12:23.610 --> 00:12:25.980
You practiced really hard, didn't you, Futaba?

00:12:25.980 --> 00:12:27.010
You've got it!

00:12:27.520 --> 00:12:29.010
Uh-huh!

00:12:29.680 --> 00:12:31.270
Looking good, looking good.

00:12:33.480 --> 00:12:38.290
I wonder if there are a lot
of people in the audience now...

00:12:38.290 --> 00:12:40.070
I don't know...

00:12:40.580 --> 00:12:43.090
I'm going to go scout it out!

00:12:43.500 --> 00:12:44.450
Huh? Konno-san?

00:12:44.450 --> 00:12:47.890
You must not... look at the event venue...

00:12:50.920 --> 00:12:54.000
That's why I told you not to look...

00:12:54.000 --> 00:12:56.470
Well, it can't be helped.

00:12:56.470 --> 00:12:59.500
Right now, we should accept that
not many people know who we are.

00:12:59.500 --> 00:13:01.980
You're right...

00:13:01.980 --> 00:13:04.650
Even so, for the people who did come-

00:13:04.650 --> 00:13:06.310
Let's do our best!

00:13:06.310 --> 00:13:07.760
Yeah!

00:13:07.760 --> 00:13:09.300
All right, let's do it!
They're so dependable.

00:13:09.300 --> 00:13:10.010
Let's do our best!
They're so dependable.

00:13:10.010 --> 00:13:10.420
Let's do our best!

00:13:10.420 --> 00:13:10.840
Yeah!

00:13:10.840 --> 00:13:11.990
Do our best!

00:13:12.830 --> 00:13:14.510
A few days later

00:13:28.570 --> 00:13:32.670
A 32-year-old career woman
working hard at her job.

00:13:32.670 --> 00:13:34.930
Confident and strong-willed...

00:13:34.930 --> 00:13:37.740
Oh, can I do this...?

00:13:37.740 --> 00:13:39.760
Why are you wimping out now?

00:13:39.760 --> 00:13:41.500
Do it like you have nothing to lose.

00:13:41.500 --> 00:13:43.520
Nothing to lose?

00:13:47.630 --> 00:13:50.390
Hidaka-san! It has been a long time.

00:13:50.390 --> 00:13:52.780
It's Hidaka Noriko-san!

00:13:52.780 --> 00:13:54.140
Good morning!
Good morning!

00:13:54.140 --> 00:13:55.990
Hello.

00:13:55.990 --> 00:13:57.060
Oh, here for an audition?

00:13:57.060 --> 00:13:58.870
Yes, in Studio A.

00:13:58.870 --> 00:14:00.950
I see. Do your best!

00:14:05.150 --> 00:14:08.320
Ichinose Futaba from
Aozora Production, please come in.

00:14:08.650 --> 00:14:10.410
O-Okay!

00:14:20.250 --> 00:14:22.390
Okay, please go ahead.

00:14:22.390 --> 00:14:24.100
Thank you!

00:14:26.960 --> 00:14:28.880
Okay, thank you!

00:14:28.880 --> 00:14:30.690
Thank you very much!

00:14:41.520 --> 00:14:44.370
Konno-san... um, I...

00:14:45.730 --> 00:14:51.360
It was pretty good! The people
listening with us seemed to like it, too.

00:14:51.990 --> 00:14:54.720
R-Really?!

00:14:54.720 --> 00:14:57.590
Oh, good!

00:14:57.590 --> 00:15:01.470
I was depressed because
I thought I had failed completely.

00:15:01.470 --> 00:15:03.140
Thank you very much!

00:15:04.500 --> 00:15:06.050
Good work today!

00:15:09.650 --> 00:15:11.150
Konno!

00:15:11.150 --> 00:15:12.150
Yes, ma'am?

00:15:13.880 --> 00:15:15.880
Why did you say such irresponsible things?

00:15:15.880 --> 00:15:20.350
I'm sorry. But Ichinose-san did her best.

00:15:20.350 --> 00:15:23.190
That has nothing to do with
whether her acting was good or bad.

00:15:24.770 --> 00:15:27.290
It's important to keep the actors motivated.

00:15:27.290 --> 00:15:31.860
But you should not be saying things that get
their hopes up just to make them feel better.

00:15:32.460 --> 00:15:36.160
It's the actors themselves who have
to accept the results of the audition.

00:15:36.760 --> 00:15:40.010
Temporary peace of mind
could have the opposite effect.

00:15:40.010 --> 00:15:41.160
Yes, ma'am...

00:15:42.200 --> 00:15:45.760
Well, I understand why you'd
want to make her feel better.

00:15:45.760 --> 00:15:50.600
Ichinose has never played
an adult woman before...

00:15:50.600 --> 00:15:52.340
Was it too hard after all?

00:15:55.050 --> 00:15:59.780
But to be able to try doing a part
that we've never done before

00:15:59.780 --> 00:16:02.440
is something that makes us
happy as actors, you know.

00:16:02.440 --> 00:16:03.940
Hidaka-san?!

00:16:03.940 --> 00:16:07.940
I'm sorry. I accidentally
overheard your conversation.

00:16:08.700 --> 00:16:10.440
I apologize.

00:16:11.000 --> 00:16:16.250
You know, when all I was
doing was girl characters,

00:16:16.250 --> 00:16:18.550
and then I got the part for a boy,

00:16:18.550 --> 00:16:25.330
I had trouble at first, but now
I'm glad to have gotten that part.

00:16:26.080 --> 00:16:31.850
Because I was allowed to try, I was able to get
the new weapon of a boy character, I think.

00:16:31.850 --> 00:16:32.880
Weapon?

00:16:32.880 --> 00:16:38.140
That's right. It's something I don't think
I would have been able to find on my own.

00:16:38.720 --> 00:16:42.530
Do your best. We're actors only
because we have you, our managers.

00:16:43.810 --> 00:16:45.850
Good work today!

00:16:45.850 --> 00:16:47.390
Good work today.

00:16:47.390 --> 00:16:49.540
Thank you very much!

00:16:52.920 --> 00:16:56.860
Excuse me, about Ichinose Futaba,
whom I spoke with you about the other day...

00:16:56.860 --> 00:16:59.340
Konno-san, you're very persistent...

00:17:02.910 --> 00:17:07.330
Oh right. It's not a very big part, but...

00:17:07.330 --> 00:17:08.970
Do you want her to try it?

00:17:09.920 --> 00:17:12.340
Y-Yes, please!

00:17:14.840 --> 00:17:17.400
Recording for <i>Mochi-Kuma?</i>

00:17:17.400 --> 00:17:20.850
Yes, yes! Thank you very much!

00:17:20.850 --> 00:17:25.570
Let's see... It starts at 4 p.m. on the 24th...

00:17:25.570 --> 00:17:27.600
Wait, that day is...

00:17:28.060 --> 00:17:32.450
That's right. It's the same as the day
you have recording for a cell phone game.

00:17:32.450 --> 00:17:34.580
I have two jobs on the same day?

00:17:34.580 --> 00:17:36.750
Wow, it's my first time!

00:17:36.750 --> 00:17:38.040
It's like I'm popular-

00:17:38.040 --> 00:17:39.590
Whoa, ow...!

00:17:39.590 --> 00:17:40.700
Are you all right?

00:17:41.510 --> 00:17:43.570
I-I'm fine...

00:17:47.200 --> 00:17:50.850
Neither is a part with
that many lines, though...

00:17:50.850 --> 00:17:53.930
But I'm still happy!

00:17:53.930 --> 00:17:57.630
lchinose-san, let's get fired up!
It's time to give it your all!

00:17:59.090 --> 00:18:00.010
Yes, ma'am!

00:18:00.300 --> 00:18:04.860
Okay, I will contact you again
with details about the time and place.

00:18:06.010 --> 00:18:07.020
All right!

00:18:12.900 --> 00:18:15.910
We can't move yet, Driver?

00:18:15.910 --> 00:18:18.500
There's a lot of construction this time of year.

00:18:18.500 --> 00:18:20.960
Oh dear, I can't do anything about it.

00:18:23.570 --> 00:18:26.120
To go to my next studio by taxi...

00:18:26.120 --> 00:18:28.330
It's like I'm finally a popular seiyuu!

00:18:30.120 --> 00:18:37.100
l'm sorry, lchinose-san, I should have
hurried the game recording more.

00:18:37.100 --> 00:18:41.840
Hm? Oh, no, it's not your fault, Konno-san.

00:18:41.840 --> 00:18:43.570
That's great!

00:18:43.570 --> 00:18:47.110
Next, you're sad, but angry!

00:18:47.110 --> 00:18:52.240
Let's do about five
different versions like that!

00:18:52.240 --> 00:18:55.110
No one would have been able
to interrupt him in that state.

00:18:55.110 --> 00:19:00.570
But at this rate, we'll definitely
be late to the next studio...

00:19:04.570 --> 00:19:05.960
Shall we run for it?

00:19:06.660 --> 00:19:09.570
From here, I'm sure that would be faster!

00:19:13.910 --> 00:19:15.590
Let's go, Konno-san.

00:19:16.900 --> 00:19:18.090
Yeah.

00:19:18.090 --> 00:19:19.370
Ready...

00:19:19.370 --> 00:19:21.310
Go!

00:19:21.310 --> 00:19:22.040
Whoops...

00:19:25.510 --> 00:19:27.860
The light has turned green.

00:19:29.680 --> 00:19:33.300
Oh my, thank you for your help.

00:19:35.060 --> 00:19:36.700
lchinose-san!

00:19:36.700 --> 00:19:39.540
This way! This is a shortcut!

00:19:40.490 --> 00:19:42.030
Backing up. Backing up.

00:19:42.030 --> 00:19:43.240
All right, all right.

00:19:43.240 --> 00:19:44.040
l-l'm sorry...!
All right, all right.

00:19:44.040 --> 00:19:45.410
l-l'm sorry...!

00:19:47.990 --> 00:19:49.090
Are you all right?

00:19:49.090 --> 00:19:50.120
I can hold your bag.

00:19:50.120 --> 00:19:56.720
I'm fine. More. importantly, you're not
out of breath running this much, lchinose-san?

00:19:59.250 --> 00:20:02.520
I'm a seiyuu. I've trained up my lung capacity-

00:20:08.680 --> 00:20:10.430
If we just turn here-

00:20:14.200 --> 00:20:15.740
Konno-san?!

00:20:15.740 --> 00:20:18.410
Forget about me...

00:20:18.410 --> 00:20:19.820
Please go on ahead!

00:20:19.820 --> 00:20:20.570
But-

00:20:20.570 --> 00:20:24.070
I will definitely catch up! So, hurry!

00:20:26.990 --> 00:20:33.330
All right! I won't forget you, Konno-san!

00:20:45.010 --> 00:20:48.510
Good morning. I'm from Aozora Production.

00:20:48.510 --> 00:20:50.900
Oh, Atsumari-san!

00:20:50.900 --> 00:20:52.780
H-How's lchinose-san...?

00:20:54.040 --> 00:20:56.690
Oh, she made it somehow.

00:20:58.160 --> 00:21:00.440
Um, and...

00:21:01.320 --> 00:21:03.650
Oh, you were here, Konno-san?

00:21:04.550 --> 00:21:09.460
I apologize for almost bringing
Ichinose-san to the studio late!

00:21:09.460 --> 00:21:12.300
Oh, it was fine, though.

00:21:12.300 --> 00:21:16.970
More importantly, Ichinose-san was
interesting. I liked what she did.

00:21:18.430 --> 00:21:19.540
Konno-san!

00:21:21.840 --> 00:21:23.840
Oh, lchinose-san!

00:21:27.720 --> 00:21:29.530
I was praised!

00:21:29.530 --> 00:21:34.640
It was my first time in that kind of role,
but the sound director said it was good.

00:21:34.640 --> 00:21:37.990
It was thanks to you
for getting me this job, Konno-san!

00:21:37.990 --> 00:21:39.780
Thank you so much!

00:21:39.780 --> 00:21:41.900
Konno, it was a huge success!

00:21:41.900 --> 00:21:44.660
It was all because of you. Thank you!

00:21:49.860 --> 00:21:52.800
O-Oh, I'm sorry! Konno-san?

00:21:52.800 --> 00:21:56.010
It's just been a while
since I sprinted all out...

00:21:56.010 --> 00:21:59.920
Yeah, we were really in a pinch...

00:21:59.920 --> 00:22:03.980
By the way, Konno,
you didn't have to sprint all out...

00:22:03.980 --> 00:22:06.980
You could have just called.

00:22:30.940 --> 00:22:32.300
Thank you.

00:22:32.300 --> 00:22:34.630
Please express your gratitude to someone dear to you.

00:22:34.630 --> 00:22:36.220
Futaba-san, go ahead.

00:22:36.220 --> 00:22:41.430
Dear Konno Aoi-sama, thank you for always
staying by my side and helping me...

00:22:41.430 --> 00:22:44.000
When times are happy,
or when times are hard...

00:22:44.000 --> 00:22:44.920
Beef bowls...

00:22:44.920 --> 00:22:45.730
Beef bowls?

00:22:45.730 --> 00:22:49.230
maneejaa-san ni arigatou
Thank you, Manager

00:22:49.230 --> 00:22:53.190
koe no oshigoto de ongaeshi
I'll repay you with my voice work

00:22:53.190 --> 00:22:56.490
kansha no kimochi itsumo mune ni
I'll always keep this feeling of thanks in my heart!

00:22:56.490 --> 00:22:58.530
All right, let's move on to the request!

00:22:58.530 --> 00:23:01.820
From <i>Slayers</i>, "Get Along"!

00:23:01.820 --> 00:23:05.400
Far away omou mama wa ga mama ni
Far away, doing as I please

00:23:05.400 --> 00:23:09.040
tabi o tsuzukete yukitai
I don't want this journey to ever end.

00:23:09.040 --> 00:23:11.420
tsurai hibi mo
Even the worst of days...

00:23:11.420 --> 00:23:15.090
egao de piriodo yo
l'll keep smiling.

00:23:15.090 --> 00:23:17.090
Okay, with energy now!

00:23:17.090 --> 00:23:18.970
One, two, three, go!
